{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"算术曲线"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"算术曲线"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>算术曲线是对"},{"Local":{"url":"数域","text":"数域"}},{"Plain":"的整数环的"},{"Local":{"url":"谱(代数)","text":"谱"}},{"Plain":"的 “紧化”, 加入 “无穷远” (Archimedes) 的"},{"Local":{"url":"位","text":"位"}},{"Plain":". 这些位来自于数域到 $\\mathbb{R}$ 或 $\\mathbb{C}$ 的嵌入.</p>\n"}]}}